      "content": "If you are experiencing sudden, recurring episodes of confusion, even if they are brief, you should treat this seriously and prioritize seeing a medical professional. While supplements like Lion's Mane or melatonin can support general brain health, they are not a quick fix for neurological symptoms. Since you are worried, a quick call to a nurse hotline or urgent care might be a less stressful first step than a full appointment to get immediate reassurance.",
      "source": "target",
